# purchases pack. Enable with NANO_PACKS=core,purchases. Nothing here is required.

# Where link-cli keeps its Link login. Defaults to $NANO_DATA_DIR/link/auth.json.
# Point it at a copy of another install's link-cli config to reuse that login.
# LINK_AUTH_FILE=/data/link/auth.json

# Minutes without a browser command before Chromium shuts down. Default 15.
# NANO_BROWSER_IDLE_MINUTES=15
# Use 0 to keep the browser open until explicitly closed (useful for login/email waits).

# Browser profile, screenshots and downloads. Default $NANO_DATA_DIR/browser.
# NANO_BROWSER_DIR=/data/browser
